  "claims": [
    {
      "text": "After Dong Fang Yu Liang vanishes, he dispels concealment and leads Dong Fang tribe Gu Immortals to search the site. Others call him first supreme elder and note Chang Fan’s special care for him before death. He refuses the title in his heart, saying only Dong Fang Chang Fan can be the tribe’s first supreme elder. The tribe knows Chang Fan nurtured him. He uses Chang Fan’s dying instructions to read shifting aura clues from the teleportation Gu formation and tells the others to follow him.",
      "chapters": [
        784
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "intro",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "char_dong_fang_yu_liang",
        "fac_dong_fang_tribe",
        "sys_gu_immortal",
        "char_dong_fang_chang_fan",
        "sys_gu_formation"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Chang Fan’s star will states that before death the main body instructed Wan Xiu in the correct method to obtain the secret passageway from the teleportation Gu formation. When the traitor among the eight still will not own up, Wan Xiu screams who betrayed their bloodline and tribe.",
      "chapters": [
        787
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "star-will-plot",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
    },
    {
      "text": "In the hall he stands first and says that for Dong Fang tribe he has no reason not to move as Chang Fan planned. He coldly tells the traitor to reveal now or it will be too late, then enters the formation with the other seven when none step forward.",
      "chapters": [
        788
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "sacrifice-formation",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
    },
    {
      "text": "When the formation’s true defensive purpose and possession price are exposed, he stares, denies the truth, and cries out why Chang Fan is harming them. The star will explains that the eight Gu Immortals sacrifice themselves to supply a new wisdom path immortal aperture for possession.",
      "chapters": [
        789
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "death",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
    },
    {
      "text": "During later fighting, Dong Fang Yu Liang suddenly stops as Wan Xiu’s furious roar resounds within him, vowing to take the enemy down together, and the body charges into thousand disintegrations.",
      "chapters": [
        794
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "will-in-yu-liang",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
    },
    {
      "text": "Fang Yuan notes that in his previous life Dong Fang tribe Gu Immortals such as Dong Fang Yi Kong and Dong Fang Wan Xiu were still alive, but in the present timeline they were sacrificed.",
      "chapters": [
        795
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "prior-life-survival",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "char_fang_yuan",
        "char_dong_fang_yi_kong"
      ]
    }
  ],
